SUMMARY:The Wisdom of the Odyssey with Phil Cousineau
DESCRIPTION:As audiences around the world return to Homer’s timeless epic through Christopher Nolan’s highly anticipated film The Odyssey\, opening in theaters on July 17\, acclaimed mythologist\, filmmaker\, and bestselling author Phil Cousineau will offer a deeper journey into the story’s enduring lessons during a book talk at the Varsity Theatre on Sunday\, July 19th from Noon to 1:30 p.m. \nJoin us for an afternoon discussion about his new book The Wisdom of the Odyssey\, where Cousineau will explore the deeper and soulful meaning of the original Odyssey: the journey that changes everything. \nCousineau will explore how the timeless lessons of The Odyssey can illuminate our own journeys\, offering wisdom on resilience\, healing\, homecoming\, love\, and finding our way through life’s greatest challenges.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-wisdom-of-the-odyssey-with-phil-cousineau/
LOCATION:Varsity Theatre\, 616 2nd St.
CATEGORIES:Books & Talks
